                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I have played lots of Werewolf, One-night werewolf and Town of Salem over the years. I will always recommend them to anyone as it is simply an amazing genre. Werewolves Within seems like it is a great interpretation of the classic game, using VR in the best way possible in a beautiful setting.\n\nUnfortunately I can only guess whether the game is great or not cause I have not been able to play it. More than a year afters its release and the playerbase is still so small that it seemed impossible to get a game started. I chatted with a guy from Ireland for 20 minutes while waiting for more people to join our lobby. While it was nice, I decided to give up on the game in the end. It seems to me like you will need to spend as much time waiting for players to join, as you will spend actually playing the game. That simply doesn't work.",
